      "tool": "sme_investor_update_writer_decision",
      "prompt": "Create a pragmatic owner decision plan for KPI narrative, wins and problems, cash runway, specific asks, and fact-versus-projection separation. Include the recommended decision, rejected alternatives, first 72-hour actions, owners, metrics, and review triggers. Keep advice bounded by the provided facts and mark anything that needs finance, legal, safety, or compliance review. Return JSON only.",
